<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Wrist for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>The wrist slot is easy, as we have multiple great options. However <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71992/bracers-of-destructive-strength">
<img alt="Bracers of Destructive Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Destructive Strength</span></a> are surperior, due to their high item level, stat budget and two sockets. However, they might be expensive to craft early on.<br/>Note that the next best option is also a BoE and can therefore be sent from another character or bought from another player on the Auction House.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96261/enchant-bracer-major-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Strength</span></a>
