<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Hands for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78765/necrotic-boneplate-gauntlets">
