<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Legs for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>Yet another craftable item with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71983/unstoppable-destroyers-legplates">
<img alt="Unstoppable Destroyer's Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unstoppable Destroyer's Legplates</span></a>. If you are unable to obtain these, just grab the tier piece <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78802/necrotic-boneplate-greaves">
<img alt="Necrotic Boneplate Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necrotic Boneplate Greaves</span></a>. The tier legs are still very strong and can easily be slotted into your set without issues.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
