<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Trinkets for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>There are only really two great options here in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77977/eye-of-unmaking">
<img alt="Eye of Unmaking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_soulgem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Unmaking</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77972/creche-of-the-final-dragon">
<img alt="Creche of the Final Dragon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Creche of the Final Dragon</span></a>. It cannot be understated how powerful these two trinkets are. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78002/bone-link-fetish">
<img alt="Bone-Link Fetish" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone-Link Fetish</span></a> can be picked up for AoE and cleave scenarios. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56393/heart-of-solace">
<img alt="Heart of Solace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persecution.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Solace</span></a> can serve as placeholders until you have both your BiS trinkets.<div class="pad"></div>
