<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="sigils-for-unholy-death-knight-dps">Sigils for Unholy Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77081/gutripper-shard">
<img alt="Gutripper Shard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gutripper Shard</span></a> is the clear winner. It is not the most important item to purchase, but it is the best available sigil in the game, and will last you for the rest of the expansion. Until you have enough Valor and have bought the more impactful items, you can just stick to the other options<div class="pad"></div>
